{"strongs": "H0663", "word": "אֲפֵק", "translit": "a.pheq", "root": "אפן", "morph": "N:N--L", "pos": "proper name, of a location", "gloss": "Aphek", "definition": "אֲפֵק אֲפִיק ( Judg 1:31 ) proper name, of a location Aphek (perhaps enclosure , or fortress ). ** now probable that 1 should include Josh 12:18 ; 1Sam 4:1 ; 1Sam 29:1 and 2Kgs 13:22 : ᵐ5 L; town not near Jezreel, but at north end of philistine plain; compare ᵐ5 L i. with We compare 254 Dr 1Sam 29:11 RS OTJC 2.435 GASm Geogr. 400 f. Buhl Geogr. 212 (and N.) Bu RS 235 f. ; more doubtful are 1Kgs 20:26 ; 1Kgs 20:30 ; 2Kgs 13:17 (Kit 1Kgs 20:26 ); these, with Josh 19:30 ; Judg 1:31 , might denote an Aphek near Jezreel. 1. city near Jezreel (Assyrian Ap‡u , compare Dl Pa 287 ) Josh 12:18 ; 1Sam 29:1 ( אֲפֵ֑קָה , so) 1Kgs 20:26 ; 1Kgs 20:30 compare 2Kgs 13:7 2. city in tribe of Asher Josh 19:30 ; Judg 1:31 ( אֲפִיק ). 3. city northeast of Beirût, modern Afqa Josh 13:4 אֲפֵ֑קָת see Di . 4. place near Mizpah 1Sam 4:1 (compare 1Sam 7:12 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB680')\">BDB680</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H663')\">H663</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB679')\">BDB679</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB681')\">BDB681</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>אֲפֵק</bdbheb> <bdbheb>אֲפִיק</bdbheb> (<ref ref=\"Judg 1:31\" b=\"7\" cBegin=\"1\" vBegin=\"31\" cEnd=\"1\" vEnd=\"31\" onclick=\"bcv(7,1,31)\">Judg 1:31</ref>) <b>proper name, of a location</b> <highlightword>Aphek</highlightword> (perhaps <highlight>enclosure</highlight>, or <highlight>fortress</highlight>). <div class=\"remarks\"><b>**</b>now probable that <b>1</b> should include <ref ref=\"Josh 12:18\" b=\"6\" cBegin=\"12\" vBegin=\"18\" cEnd=\"12\" vEnd=\"18\" onclick=\"bcv(6,12,18)\">Josh 12:18</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 4:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"4\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"4\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(9,4,1)\">1Sam 4:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Sam 29:1\" b=\"9\" cBegin=\"29\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"29\" vEn